Request Handler Routing: - The SDK uses JSON-RPC request schemas to route incoming calls. We register handlers for ListToolsRequestSchema,CallToolRequestSchema,ListResourcesRequestSchema, andReadResourceRequestSchema. This clean separation ensures our server can dynamically advertise its capabilities and execute business logic safely.

